---
import { CONTACTS } from "../../lib/constants";
---

<section id="section-contacts-video" class="vn-contacts-video">
  <div class="vn-container">
    <div class="vn-grid-12 vn-contacts-video__grid">
      <div class="vn-contacts-video__content" style="grid-column: 1 / 6">
        <span class="vn-label-mono vn-contacts-video__label"
          >Онлайн-встреча</span
        >
        <h2>Можно провести встречу онлайн</h2>
        <p>
          За 40 минут разберём задачу, ограничения по военной ипотеке и
          следующий шаг без поездки в офис.
        </p>

        <div class="vn-contacts-video__benefits">
          <div>
            <span>01</span>
            <p>Подключаетесь из дома, части или другого региона</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>02</span>
            <p>Разбираем Краснодар, Крым, переезд, жизнь или вложение</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span>03</span>
            <p>На выходе понятно, что проверить и куда двигаться дальше</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-contacts-video__actions">
          <a
            href="/contacts/#request"
            data-modal-open
            data-modal-title="Записаться на видеовстречу"
            class="vn-btn-primary"
          >
            Записаться на видеовстречу
          </a>
          <a
            href={CONTACTS.telegram}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="vn-contacts-video__link">Telegram</a
          >
          <a
            href={CONTACTS.max.startsWith("[") ? "#" : CONTACTS.max}
            target={CONTACTS.max.startsWith("[") ? undefined : "_blank"}
            rel={CONTACTS.max.startsWith("[")
              ? undefined
              : "noopener noreferrer"}
            aria-disabled={CONTACTS.max.startsWith("[") ? "true" : undefined}
            class:list={[
              "vn-contacts-video__link",
              {
                "vn-contacts-video__link--disabled":
                  CONTACTS.max.startsWith("["),
              },
            ]}
          >
            Max
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="vn-contacts-video__visual"
        style="grid-column: 7 / 13"
        aria-label="Визуализация видеовстречи"
        role="img"
      >
        <div class="vn-contacts-video__window">
          <div class="vn-contacts-video__bar">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            <strong>video-meeting</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="vn-contacts-video__call">
            <div
              class="vn-contacts-video__participant vn-contacts-video__participant--main"
            >
              <span></span>
              <p>Разбор задачи</p>
            </div>
            <div class="vn-contacts-video__participant">
              <span></span>
              <p>Клиент</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="vn-contacts-video__agenda">
            <h3>Что разбираем</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Цель покупки</li>
              <li>Район и объект</li>
              <li>Бюджет и документы</li>
              <li>Следующий шаг</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="vn-contacts-video__footer">
            <span>40 минут</span>
            <span>онлайн</span>
            <span>без поездки в офис</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vn-contacts-video {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 22% 12%,
        color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-cta) 14%, transparent) 0%,
        transparent 34%
      ),
      var(--color-bg-dark);
    padding: 104px 0;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(
        to right,
        var(--color-deco-grid-dark) 1px,
        transparent 1px
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        var(--color-deco-grid-dark) 1px,
        transparent 1px
      );
    background-size: 64px 64px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__label {
    color: var(--color-accent-cta);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-ondark);
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__content > p {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    max-width: 480px;
    color: var(--color-text-ondark-mute);
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__benefits {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__benefits div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 42px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-ondark);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__benefits span {
    color: var(--color-accent-cta);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__benefits p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-ondark-mute);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 34px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 42px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-ondark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    color: var(--color-text-ondark);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap; /* Запрещает разрыв текста внутри ссылки */
    transition:
      background-color 150ms ease,
      border-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__link:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-color: rgba(241, 243, 245, 0.28);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__link--disabled {
    color: var(--color-text-ondark-mute);
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__visual {
    position: relative;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__window {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-ondark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg-dark-elev) 90%, transparent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-ondark);
    color: var(--color-text-ondark-mute);
    font-size: var(--fs-label);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__bar span {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(241, 243, 245, 0.24);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__bar strong {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__call {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__participant {
    min-height: 154px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(241, 243, 245, 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(241, 243, 245, 0.11),
      rgba(241, 243, 245, 0.03)
    );
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__participant--main {
    min-height: 220px;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__participant span {
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    margin-bottom: auto;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--color-accent-cta) 32%,
      rgba(241, 243, 245, 0.18)
    );
    border: 1px solid rgba(241, 243, 245, 0.14);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__participant p {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-ondark);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__agenda {
    margin: 0 18px 18px;
    padding: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-ondark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: rgba(15, 20, 25, 0.34);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__agenda h3 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-ondark);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__agenda ul {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 10px 14px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__agenda li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text-ondark-mute);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__agenda li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 7px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent-cta);
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__footer {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 0 18px 18px;
  }

  .vn-contacts-video__footer span {
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: rgba(241, 243, 245, 0.08);
    color: var(--color-text-ondark-mute);
    font-size: var(--fs-label);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .vn-contacts-video__content,
    .vn-contacts-video__visual {
      grid-column: 1 / -1 !important;
    }

    .vn-contacts-video__visual {
      margin-top: 42px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .vn-contacts-video {
      padding: 64px 0;
    }

    .vn-contacts-video__actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .vn-contacts-video__actions .vn-btn-primary,
    .vn-contacts-video__link {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .vn-contacts-video__call,
    .vn-contacts-video__agenda ul {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .vn-contacts-video__participant,
    .vn-contacts-video__participant--main {
      min-height: 136px;
    }
  }
</style>
